WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:01.600
Wait, wait, wait, don't look at it.

2
00:00:01.633 --> 00:00:03.133
Don't look at it. Come on.

3
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:05.233
Okay Abe, you can go ahead now.

4
00:00:09.133 --> 00:00:10.133
Whoa.

5
00:00:10.133 --> 00:00:11.067
It's bright.

6
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:12.167
See anything?

7
00:00:12.267 --> 00:00:13.567
I see a white blob.

8
00:00:18.367 --> 00:00:19.833
Whoa, it changed.

9
00:00:20.033 --> 00:00:21.667
Is it moving?

10
00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:24.933
We're both moving, but we're in sync.

11
00:00:25.067 --> 00:00:28.233
When you're at that magnification, it's really apparent.

12
00:00:28.433 --> 00:00:32.133
It just changed from being full of just Moon

13
00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:34.467
to... now I can see the edge.

14
00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:41.867
That is really cool.

15
00:00:43.267 --> 00:00:44.600
We should have shot this.

16
00:00:44.867 --> 00:00:46.867
Oh, I see it now. Yeah, I see it. I see it.

17
00:00:49.367 --> 00:00:50.567
What do you think?

18
00:00:51.067 --> 00:00:53.167
Pretty cool, huh?

19
00:00:53.867 --> 00:00:56.367
Not the reaction I was hoping for, but whatever.

20
00:00:56.467 --> 00:00:58.167
Some of us are brought to tears.

21
00:00:58.867 --> 00:01:00.167
Oh, whoa, that's cool.

22
00:01:00.467 --> 00:01:01.767
There we go.

23
00:01:02.667 --> 00:01:04.367
I wasn't seeing all the way.

24
00:01:04.467 --> 00:01:06.067
Your reaction was very subdued.

25
00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:07.767
He's looking at the top of the dome.

26
00:01:14.067 --> 00:01:18.367
They say it's actually more interesting to photograph the Moon when it's not full.
